{"step_index":46,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-26T03:49:30Z","thinking":"**Developing Game Logic**\n\nOkay, I've updated the `css/style.css` file. Now I'm focusing on the `js/app.js` file, aiming to write comprehensive game logic and controllers for all eight levels. I'm currently reviewing the specific logic requirements for each level, starting with `initLevel1()`, which involves drag-and-drop interactions from Group 1. I'll need to figure out how to add the Group 1 items: Áo thun 👕, Quần thun 👖.\n\n\n**Refining Level Interactions**\n\nI'm now fully immersed in refining the level interactions. Specifically, I've got `initLevel1()` and `initLevel2()` functioning. I've designed the drag-and-drop mechanics for Group 1 items, including updates to the Bin avatar, sound effects, and feedback. Successfully implemented the bounce-back interactions for disallowed items and associated audio. I'm building on this foundation to move into the check-in component of `initLevel3()`.\n\n\n**Designing Level Flow**\n\nI've been designing the flow for Levels 4 and 5. For Level 4, it's about navigating Bin through the airport. I've designed logic for choosing the correct gate based on the ticket, including feedback for both correct and incorrect choices. Level 5 focuses on the seatbelt interaction. I'm focusing on the steps to secure the belt, including sound and visual feedback for each step.\n\n\n**Implementing Level 6 & 7**\n\nI've just added `initLevel6()` logic: tap the clouds in the sky, each morphing into a different object with sound effects. Each morph triggers a different Bin response and a visual effect. The next level now in progress is `initLevel7()`, which will have Bin interacting with the environment, and adjusting the volume slider to respond to a \"Suỵt\" from Mẹ. The goal here is to get floating hearts from the passengers.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"/**\n * app.js - Main Game Controller for \"Cùng Bé Bin Đi Máy Bay\" (8 Levels)\n * Tối ưu hóa phản xạ mầm non 3-4 tuổi (Tap & Drag, Voice-over Bố & Mẹ)\n */\n\nclass KidFlightApp {\n    constructor() {\n        this.currentScreen = 1;\n        this.totalScreens = 8;\n        \n        // Trạng thái các Level\n        this.level1Dressed = { shirt: false, pants: false, shoes: false };\n        this.level2Packed = 0;\n        this.level3Steps = { checkin: false, xrayCount: 0, gate: false };\n        this.level4Gate = false;\n        this.level5Belt = { inserted: false, tightened: false, earRelieved: false };\n        this.level6Clouds = { c1: false, c2: false, c3: false, c4: false };\n        this.level7Tasks = { volume: false, leg: false };\n        this.level8Tasks = { unbuckle: false, baggage: false };\n\n        this.parentHoldStart = 0;\n        this.parentHoldReqId = null;\n\n        this.init();\n    }\n\n    init() {\n        this.bindGlobalEvents();\n        this.initLevel1();\n        this.showScreen(1);\n    }\n\n    // --- SCREEN NAVIGATION & SPEECH TRIGGER ---\n    showScreen(screenNum) {\n        if (screenNum < 1 || screenNum > this.totalScreens) return;\n\n        if (this.currentScreen === 5 && screenNum !== 5) {\n            if (window.audioMgr) window.audioMgr.stopEngineSound();\n        }\n\n        this.currentScreen = screenNum;\n\n        // Cập nhật DOM screen\n        document.querySelectorAll('.screen').forEach((scr, idx) => {\n            if (idx + 1 === screenNum) {\n                scr.classList.add('active');\n            } else {\n                scr.classList.remove('active');\n            }\n        });\n\n        // Cập nhật Stage dots\n        document.querySelectorAll('.stage-dot').forEach((dot, idx) => {\n            dot.classList.remove('active');\n            if (idx + 1 === screenNum) {\n                dot.classList.add('active');\n            }\n            if (idx + 1 < screenNum) {\n                dot.classList.add('completed');\n            }\n        });\n\n        this.triggerScreenVoice(screenNum);\n    }\n\n    triggerScreenVoice(screenNum) {\n        if (!window.audioMgr) return;\n\n        switch (screenNum) {\n            case 1:\n                window.audioMgr.speak('Mẹ', 'Bin ơi, hôm nay mình đi máy bay cả ngày đấy. Con hãy chọn những bộ quần áo thật thoải mái và dễ cởi để mặc nhé!');\n                break;\n            case 2:\n                window.audioMgr.speak('Bố', 'Bin giúp Mẹ xếp đồ vào vali nhé, món nào cấm thì mình để lại nhà nha!');\n                break;\n            case 3:\n                window.audioMgr.speak('Mẹ', 'Mình gửi vali qua máy soi chiếu nhé. Vali chỉ đi chơi một chút rồi quay lại ngay thôi!');\n                break;\n            case 4:\n                window.audioMgr.speak('Bố', 'Nhìn qua cửa kính kìa Bin, máy bay đang đợi! Cùng tìm đúng Cửa 03 trên vé nào!');\n                break;\n            case 5:\n                window.audioMgr.speak('Mẹ', 'Bin ngồi vào ghế rồi! Mình cùng thắt đai an toàn để thành Hiệp sĩ bay vững vàng nhé!');\n                break;\n            case 6:\n                window.audioMgr.speak('Bố', 'Máy bay đang bay giữa bầu trời xanh rồi! Bin nhìn qua cửa sổ xem những đám mây giống hình gì nhé!');\n                break;\n            case 7:\n                window.audioMgr.speak('Mẹ', 'Mọi người đang nghỉ ngơi, Bin làm hành khách nhí lịch sự nhé!');\n                break;\n            case 8:\n                window.audioMgr.speak('Bố', 'Máy bay hạ cánh rồi! Mở đai và ra lấy vali dán hình gấu thôi nào!');\n                break;\n        }\n    }\n\n    // --- GLOBAL EVENTS & PARENT GATE ---\n    bindGlobalEvents() {\n        const btnVoice = document.getElementById('btn-repeat-voice');\n        if (btnVoice) {\n            btnVoice.addEventListener('click', () => {\n                if (window.audioMgr) {\n                    window.audioMgr.playPop();\n                    this.triggerScreenVoice(this.currentScreen);\n                }\n            });\n        }\n\n        const avatarSpeaker = document.getElementById('speaker-avatar-icon');\n        if (avatarSpeaker) {\n            avatarSpeaker.addEventListener('click', () => {\n                if (window.audioMgr) {\n                    window.audioMgr.playPop();\n                    this.triggerScreenVoice(this.currentScreen);\n                }\n            });\n        }\n\n        // Cổng Phụ Huynh: Giữ 3 giây\n        const parentBtn = document.getElementById('btn-parent-gate');\n        const holdCircle = document.getElementById('parent-ring-circle');\n        const modal = document.getElementById('parent-modal');\n        const closeModalBtn = document.getElementById('btn-close-parent');\n\n        if (parentBtn && holdCircle) {\n            const startHold = (e) => {\n                e.preventDefault();\n                this.parentHoldStart = Date.now();\n                const totalHold = 3000;\n\n                const updateRing = () => {\n                    const elapsed = Date.now() - this.parentHoldStart;\n                    const progress = Math.min(1, elapsed / totalHold);\n                    const offset = 175 - (175 * progress);\n                    holdCircle.style.strokeDashoffset = offset;\n\n                    if (progress >= 1) {\n                        if (window.audioMgr) window.audioMgr.playTing();\n                        modal.classList.add('open');\n                        resetHold();\n                    } else {\n                        this.parentHoldReqId = requestAnimationFrame(updateRing);\n                    }\n                };\n\n                this.parentHoldReqId = requestAnimationFrame(updateRing);\n            };\n\n            const resetHold = () => {\n                if (this.parentHoldReqId) cancelAnimationFrame(this.parentHoldReqId);\n                holdCircle.style.strokeDashoffset = 175;\n            };\n\n            parentBtn.addEventListener('pointerdown', startHold);\n            parentBtn.addEventListener('pointerup', resetHold);\n            parentBtn.addEventListener('pointerleave', resetHold);\n            parentBtn.addEventListener('pointercancel', resetHold);\n        }\n\n        if (closeModalBtn && modal) {\n            closeModalBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n                if (window.audioMgr) window.audioMgr.playPop();\n                modal.classList.remove('open');\n            });\n        }\n\n        const volSlider = document.getElementById('setting-volume');\n        if (volSlider) {\n            volSlider.addEventListener('input', (e) => {\n                if (window.audioMgr) window.audioMgr.volume = parseFloat(e.target.value);\n            });\n        }\n\n        const voiceToggle = document.getElementById('setting-voice');\n        if (voiceToggle) {\n            voiceToggle.addEventListener('change', (e) => {\n                if (window.audioMgr) window.audioMgr.voiceEnabled = e.target.checked;\n            });\n        }\n\n        // Chuyển màn hình qua Stage dots\n        document.querySelectorAll('.stage-dot').forEach((dot) => {\n            dot.addEventListener('click', (e) => {\n                const targetScreen = parseInt(dot.getAttribute('data-screen'), 10);\n                if (targetScreen) {\n                    if (window.audioMgr) window.audioMgr.playPop();\n                    this.initLevel(targetScreen);\n                    this.showScreen(targetScreen);\n                }\n            });\n        });\n    }\n\n    initLevel(levelNum) {\n        switch (levelNum) {\n            case 1: this.initLevel1(); break;\n            case 2: this.initLevel2(); break;\n            case 3: this.initLevel3(); break;\n            case 4: this.initLevel4(); break;\n            case 5: this.initLevel5(); break;\n            case 6: this.initLevel6(); break;\n            case 7: this.initLevel7(); break;\n            case 8: this.initLevel8(); break;\n        }\n    }\n\n    // ==========================================================================\n    // LEVEL 1: TRANG PHỤC BAY THOẢI MÁI\n    // ==========================================================================\n    initLevel1() {\n        const clothes = document.querySelectorAll('.clothes-item-btn');\n        const binFigure = document.getElementById('bin-dress-target');\n        const btnNext1 = document.getElementById('btn-next-level-1');\n\n        clothes.forEach(item => {\n            let startX = 0, startY = 0;\n            let isDragging = false;\n\n            const onDown = (e) => {\n                if (item.classList.contains('worn')) return;\n                isDragging = true;\n                item.setPointerCapture(e.pointerId);\n                startX = e.clientX;\n                startY = e.clientY;\n                item.style.zIndex = '999';\n            };\n\n            const onMove = (e) => {\n                if (!isDragging) return;\n                const dx = e.clientX - startX;\n                const dy = e.clientY - startY;\n                item.style.transform = `translate(${dx}px, ${dy}px) scale(1.2)`;\n            };\n\n            const onUp = (e) => {\n                if (!isDragging) return;\n                isDragging = false;\n                item.releasePointerCapture(e.pointerId);\n\n                const itemRect = item.getBoundingClientRect();\n                const binRect = binFigure.getBoundingClientRect();\n\n                const isOver = !(\n                    itemRect.right < binRect.left ||\n                    itemRect.left > binRect.right ||\n                    itemRect.bottom < binRect.top ||\n                    itemRect.top > binRect.bottom\n                );\n\n                const isCorrect = item.getAttribute('data-correct') === 'true';\n                const type = item.getAttribute('data-type');\n\n                if (isOver) {\n                    if (isCorrect) {\n                        // Mặc đúng!\n                        item.classList.add('worn');\n                        item.style.display = 'none';\n\n                        // Cập nhật trang phục trên người Bin\n                        if (type === 'shirt') {\n                            document.getElementById('bin-slot-shirt').textContent = '👕';\n                            this.level1Dressed.shirt = true;\n                        } else if (type === 'pants') {\n                            document.getElementById('bin-slot-pants').textContent = '🩳';\n                            this.level1Dressed.pants = true;\n                        } else if (type === 'shoes') {\n                            document.getElementById('bin-slot-shoes').textContent = '👟';\n                            this.level1Dressed.shoes = true;\n                        }\n\n                        if (window.effectsMgr) {\n                            window.effectsMgr.burstStarsAt(binRect.left + binRect.width / 2, binRect.top + binRect.height / 2);\n                        }\n                        if (window.audioMgr) window.audioMgr.playTing();\n\n                        // Kiểm tra hoàn thành\n                        if (this.level1Dressed.shirt && this.level1Dressed.pants && this.level1Dressed.shoes) {\n                            binFigure.classList.add('gentle-bounce');\n                            if (window.audioMgr) {\n                                setTimeout(() => {\n                                    window.audioMgr.speak('Mẹ', 'Bin chọn đồ giỏi quá, vừa thoải mái vừa ấm áp khi lên máy bay đấy!');\n                                }, 500);\n                            }\n                            if (btnNext1) {\n                                btnNext1.classList.remove('hidden');\n                                btnNext1.classList.add('pop-in');\n                            }\n                        }\n                    } else {\n                        // Chọn sai/bất tiện: nảy lại kèm lời nhắc của Bố\n                        item.style.transition = 'transform 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1)';\n                        item.style.transform = 'translate(0px, 0px)';\n                        if (window.audioMgr) {\n                            window.audioMgr.playBoing();\n                            window.audioMgr.speak('Bố', 'Quần bó và giày nhiều dây này sẽ làm Bin hơi khó chịu khi ngồi lâu đấy, mình chọn đồ thun mềm nhé!');\n                        }\n                    }\n                } else {\n                    item.style.transition = 'transform 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1)';\n                    item.style.transform = 'translate(0px, 0px)';\n                }\n            };\n\n            item.addEventListener('pointerdown', onDown);\n            item.addEventListener('pointermove', onMove);\n            item.addEventListener('pointerup', onUp);\n            item.addEventListener('pointercancel', onUp);\n        });\n\n        if (btnNext1) {\n            btnNext1.onclick = () => {\n                if (window.audioMgr) window.audioMgr.playPop();\n                this.initLevel2();\n                this.showScreen(2);\n            };\n        }\n    }\n\n    // ==========================================================================\n    // LEVEL 2: CHIẾC VALI KỲ DIỆU\n    // ==========================================================================\n    initLevel2() {\n        const luggageItems = document.querySelectorAll('.luggage-item-lvl2');\n        const suitcase = document.getElementById('suitcase-target-lvl2');\n        const suitcaseInner = document.getElementById('suitcase-inner-lvl2');\n        const btnNext2 = document.getElementById('btn-next-level-2');\n\n        luggageItems.forEach(item => {\n            let startX = 0, startY = 0;\n            let isDragging = false;\n\n            const onDown = (e) => {\n                if (item.classList.contains('packed')) return;\n                isDragging = true;\n                item.setPointerCapture(e.pointerId);\n                startX = e.clientX;\n                startY = e.clientY;\n                item.style.zIndex = '999';\n            };\n\n            const onMove = (e) => {\n                if (!isDragging) return;\n                const dx = e.clientX - startX;\n                const dy = e.clientY - startY;\n                item.style.transform = `translate(${dx}px, ${dy}px) scale(1.2)`;\n            };\n\n            const onUp = (e) => {\n                if (!isDragging) return;\n                isDragging = false;\n                item.releasePointerCapture(e.pointerId);\n\n                const itemRect = item.getBoundingClientRect();\n                const suitcaseRect = suitcase.getBoundingClientRect();\n\n                const isOver = !(\n                    itemRect.right < suitcaseRect.left ||\n                    itemRect.left > suitcaseRect.right ||\n                    itemRect.bottom < suitcaseRect.top ||\n                    itemRect.top > suitcaseRect.bottom\n                );\n\n                const isForbidden = item.getAttribute('data-forbidden') === 'true';\n\n                if (isOver) {\n                    if (isForbidden) {\n                        item.style.transition = 'transform 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1)';\n                        item.style.transform = 'translate(0px, 0px)';\n                        if (window.audioMgr) {\n                            window.audioMgr.playBoing();\n                            window.audioMgr.speak('Bố', 'Chai nước to và kéo nhọn không được mang lên máy bay đâu Bin ơi!');\n                        }\n                    } else {\n                        item.classList.add('packed');\n                        item.style.display = 'none';\n\n                        const iconSpan = document.createElement('span');\n                        iconSpan.textContent = item.querySelector('.item-icon').textContent;\n                        iconSpan.style.fontSize = '34px';\n                        iconSpan.className = 'pop-in';\n                        suitcaseInner.appendChild(iconSpan);\n\n                        this.level2Packed++;\n\n                        if (window.effectsMgr) {\n                            window.effectsMgr.burstStarsAt(suitcaseRect.left + suitcaseRect.width / 2, suitcaseRect.top + suitcaseRect.height / 2);\n                        }\n                        if (window.audioMgr) window.audioMgr.playTing();\n\n                        if (this.level2Packed >= 3) {\n                            if (window.audioMgr) {\n                                setTimeout(() => {\n                                    window.audioMgr.speak('Mẹ', 'Vali đã xếp gọn gàng rồi, gia đình mình cùng ra sân bay nào!');\n                                }, 500);\n                            }\n                            if (btnNext2) {\n                                btnNext2.classList.remove('hidden');\n                                btnNext2.classList.add('pop-in');\n                            }\n                        }\n                    }\n                } else {\n                    item.style.transition = 'transform 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1)';\n                    item.style.transform = 'translate(0px, 0px)';\n                }\n            };\n\n            item.addEventListener('pointerdown', onDown);\n            item.addEventListener('pointermove', onMove);\n            item.addEventListener('pointerup', onUp);\n            item.addEventListener('pointercancel', onUp);\n        });\n\n        if (btnNext2) {\n            btnNext2.onclick = () => {\n                if (window.audioMgr) window.audioMgr.playPop();\n                this.initLevel3();\n                this.showScreen(3);\n            };\n        }\n    }\n\n    // ==========================================================================\n    // LEVEL 3: CỬA SỔ X-QUANG THẦN KỲ\n    // ==========================================================================\n    initLevel3() {\n        const passCard = document.getElementById('pass-card-lvl3');\n        const stampBadge = document.getElementById('stamp-badge-lvl3');\n        const xrayBoxes = document.querySelectorAll('.xray-glow-box');\n        const trayItem = document.getElementById('tray-shoes-jacket-lvl3');\n        const gate = document.getElementById('gate-detector-lvl3');\n        const lamps = document.querySelectorAll('.gate-lamp-lvl3');\n        const binWalker = document.getElementById('bin-walker-lvl3');\n        const btnNext3 = document.getElementById('btn-next-level-3');\n\n        // Bước 1: Check-in trao vé\n        if (passCard) {\n            passCard.onclick = () => {\n                if (this.level3Steps.checkin) return;\n                this.level3Steps.checkin = true;\n                if (stampBadge) stampBadge.classList.add('stamped');\n                if (window.audioMgr) {\n                    window.audioMgr.playStamp();\n                    setTimeout(() => {\n                        window.audioMgr.speak('Tiếp viên', 'Chào gia đình bé Bin! Mời gia đình cho vali qua máy soi chiếu nhé!');\n                    }, 400);\n                }\n                this.checkLevel3Completion();\n            };\n        }\n\n        // Bước 2: Chạm khối màu X-quang\n        xrayBoxes.forEach(box => {\n            box.onclick = () => {\n                if (box.getAttribute('data-revealed') === 'true') return;\n                box.setAttribute('data-revealed', 'true');\n                box.textContent = box.getAttribute('data-item');\n                box.style.background = '#FFF9C4';\n                this.level3Steps.xrayCount++;\n\n                if (window.audioMgr) window.audioMgr.playTing();\n                if (window.effectsMgr) {\n                    const r = box.getBoundingClientRect();\n                    window.effectsMgr.burstStarsAt(r.left + r.width / 2, r.top + r.height / 2);\n                }\n\n                if (this.level3Steps.xrayCount >= 3) {\n                    if (window.audioMgr) {\n                        setTimeout(() => {\n                            window.audioMgr.speak('Mẹ', 'Đồ vật bên trong sáng lung linh chưa kìa! Bin để áo khoác lên khay và qua cổng từ nhé!');\n                        }, 400);\n                    }\n                    this.checkLevel3Completion();\n                }\n            };\n        });\n\n        // Bước 3: Cởi áo khoác lên khay và bước qua cổng từ\n        if (trayItem) {\n            trayItem.onclick = () => {\n                trayItem.style.background = '#81C784';\n                trayItem.innerHTML = '<span>🧥👟 Đã đặt lên khay ✓</span>';\n                if (window.audioMgr) window.audioMgr.playPop();\n            };\n        }\n\n        if (gate) {\n            gate.onclick = () => {\n                if (this.level3Steps.gate) return;\n                this.level3Steps.gate = true;\n\n                lamps.forEach(l => l.classList.add('green-flash'));\n                if (binWalker) binWalker.style.transform = 'translateY(-18px) scale(1.15)';\n\n                if (window.audioMgr) {\n                    window.audioMgr.playBeepBoop();\n                    window.audioMgr.playClap();\n                    setTimeout(() => {\n                        window.audioMgr.speak('Bố', 'Hoan hô Bin! Qua cổng an ninh an toàn rồi!');\n                    }, 500);\n                }\n                this.checkLevel3Completion();\n            };\n        }\n\n        if (btnNext3) {\n            btnNext3.onclick = () => {\n                if (window.audioMgr) window.audioMgr.playPop();\n                this.initLevel4();\n                this.showScreen(4);\n            };\n        }\n    }\n\n    checkLevel3Completion() {\n        const btnNext3 = document.getElementById('btn-next-level-3');\n        if (this.level3Steps.checkin && this.level3Steps.xrayCount >= 3 && this.level3Steps.gate) {\n            if (btnNext3) {\n                btnNext3.classList.remove('hidden');\n                btnNext3.classList.add('pop-in');\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    // ==========================================================================\n    // LEVEL 4: SỐ MẤY LÊN MÁY BAY (GATE 03)\n    // ==========================================================================\n    initLevel4() {\n        const gateCards = document.querySelectorAll('.gate-card-btn');\n        const jetBridge = document.getElementById('jet-bridge-walkway');\n        const binWalker = document.getElementById('bin-bridge-walker');\n        const btnNext4 = document.getElementById('btn-next-level-4');\n\n        gateCards.forEach(card => {\n            card.onclick = () => {\n                const gateNum = card.getAttribute('data-gate');\n\n                if (gateNum === '03') {\n                    if (this.level4Gate) return;\n                    this.level4Gate = true;\n                    card.classList.add('correct-gate');\n\n                    if (window.effectsMgr) {\n                        const r = card.getBoundingClientRect();\n                        window.effectsMgr.burstStarsAt(r.left + r.width / 2, r.top + r.height / 2);\n                    }\n                    if (window.audioMgr) {\n                        window.audioMgr.playTing();\n                        window.audioMgr.speak('Bố', 'Đúng rồi! Cổng 03 đây rồi, cùng bước qua ống lồng vào máy bay nào!');\n                    }\n\n                    if (jetBridge) {\n                        jetBridge.style.borderColor = '#00E676';\n                    }\n                } else {\n                    if (window.audioMgr) {\n                        window.audioMgr.playBoing();\n                        window.audioMgr.speak('Bố', 'Xem kỹ lại số trên vé nha Bin, vé ghi Cửa 03 nè!');\n                    }\n                }\n            };\n        });\n\n        if (jetBridge) {\n            jetBridge.onclick = () => {\n                if (!this.level4Gate) {\n                    if (window.audioMgr) window.audioMgr.speak('Mẹ', 'Bin tìm đúng Cổng 03 trước nhé!');\n                    return;\n                }\n\n                if (binWalker) {\n                    binWalker.style.transform = 'translateX(220px)';\n                }\n\n                if (window.audioMgr) {\n                    window.audioMgr.playTing();\n                    setTimeout(() => {\n                        window.audioMgr.speak('Tiếp viên', 'Chào mừng bé Bin và gia đình lên máy bay!');\n                    }, 400);\n                }\n\n                if (btnNext4) {\n                    btnNext4.classList.remove('hidden');\n                    btnNext4.classList.add('pop-in');\n                }\n            };\n        }\n\n        if (btnNext4) {\n            btnNext4.onclick = () => {\n                if (window.audioMgr) window.audioMgr.playPop();\n                this.initLevel5();\n                this.showScreen(5);\n            };\n        }\n    }\n\n    // ==========================================================================\n    // LEVEL 5: HIỆP SĨ ĐAI AN TOÀN & XỬ LÝ Ù TAI\n    // ==========================================================================\n    initLevel5() {\n        const strapLeft = document.getElementById('seatbelt-strap-lvl5');\n        const puzzleBox = document.getElementById('seatbelt-puzzle-lvl5');\n        const indicator = document.getElementById('safety-indicator-lvl5');\n        const cape = document.getElementById('bin-knight-cape');\n        const btnWater = document.getElementById('btn-drink-water-lvl5');\n        const earWaves = document.querySelectorAll('.ear-soundwave');\n        const btnNext5 = document.getElementById('btn-next-level-5');\n\n        // Kéo cài đai an toàn\n        if (strapLeft && puzzleBox) {\n            let isDragging = false;\n            let startX = 0;\n\n            const onDown = (e) => {\n                if (this.level5Belt.inserted) return;\n                isDragging = true;\n                strapLeft.setPointerCapture(e.pointerId);\n                startX = e.clientX;\n            };\n\n            const onMove = (e) => {\n                if (!isDragging || this.level5Belt.inserted) return;\n                const dx = Math.max(0, Math.min(45, e.clientX - startX));\n                strapLeft.style.transform = `translateX(${dx}px)`;\n\n                if (dx >= 35) {\n                    // Cài chốt CẠCH!\n                    this.level5Belt.inserted = true;\n                    this.level5Belt.tightened = true;\n                    puzzleBox.classList.add('seatbelt-buckled');\n\n                    if (indicator) indicator.classList.add('green-safe');\n                    if (cape) cape.classList.add('active');\n\n                    if (window.audioMgr) {\n                        window.audioMgr.playClack();\n                        window.audioMgr.startEngineSound(0.28);\n                        setTimeout(() => {\n                            window.audioMgr.speak('Mẹ', 'CẠCH! Bin đã thắt đai an toàn và biến thành Hiệp sĩ bay rồi!');\n                        }, 300);\n                    }\n\n                    if (window.effectsMgr) {\n                        const r = puzzleBox.getBoundingClientRect();\n                        window.effectsMgr.burstStarsAt(r.left + r.width / 2, r.top + r.height / 2);\n                    }\n\n                    // Hiện sóng âm ù tai sau 3 giây\n                    setTimeout(() => {\n                        earWaves.forEach(w => w.classList.remove('hidden'));\n                        if (btnWater) btnWater.classList.remove('hidden');\n                        if (window.audioMgr) {\n                            window.audioMgr.speak('Mẹ', 'Máy bay đang bay lên mây đấy! Nếu Bin thấy tai hơi u u, con hãy uống một ngụm nước nhé!');\n                        }\n                    }, 3500);\n                }\n            };\n\n            const onUp = (e) => {\n                if (!isDragging) return;\n                isDragging = false;\n                strapLeft.releasePointerCapture(e.pointerId);\n                if (!this.level5Belt.inserted) {\n                    strapLeft.style.transform = 'translateX(0px)';\n                }\n            };\n\n            strapLeft.addEventListener('pointerdown', onDown);\n            strapLeft.addEventListener('pointermove', onMove);\n            strapLeft.addEventListener('pointerup', onUp);\n        }\n\n        // Chạm ly nước cho Bin uống\n        if (btnWater) {\n            btnWater.onclick = () => {\n                if (this.level5Belt.earRelieved) return;\n                this.level5Belt.earRelieved = true;\n\n                earWaves.forEach(w => w.classList.add('hidden'));\n\n                if (window.effectsMgr) {\n                    const binHead = document.getElementById('bin-seat-head');\n                    if (binHead) {\n                        const r = binHead.getBoundingClientRect();\n                        window.effectsMgr.spawnMusicNotesAt(r.left + r.width / 2, r.top);\n                    }\n                }\n\n                if (window.audioMgr) {\n                    window.audioMgr.playDrinkWater();\n                    setTimeout(() => {\n                        window.audioMgr.speak('Bin', 'Hết ù tai rồi, thích quá Bố Mẹ ơi!');\n                    }, 900);\n                }\n\n                if (btnNext5) {\n                    btnNext5.classList.remove('hidden');\n                    btnNext5.classList.add('pop-in');\n                }\n            };\n        }\n\n        if (btnNext5) {\n            btnNext5.onclick = () => {\n                if (window.audioMgr) {\n                    window.audioMgr.stopEngineSound();\n                    window.audioMgr.playPop();\n                }\n                this.initLevel6();\n                this.showScreen(6);\n            };\n        }\n    }\n\n    // ==========================================================================\n    // LEVEL 6: NGẮM VÀ TƯỞNG TƯỢNG ĐÁM MÂY\n    // ==========================================================================\n    initLevel6() {\n        const cloudCards = document.querySelectorAll('.morph-cloud-card');\n        const btnNext6 = document.getElementById('btn-next-level-6');\n\n        cloudCards.forEach(card => {\n            card.onclick = () => {\n                if (card.classList.contains('morphed')) return;\n                card.classList.add('morphed');\n\n                const targetType = card.getAttribute('data-morph');\n                const icon = card.querySelector('.cloud-icon');\n                const label = card.querySelector('.cloud-label');\n\n                if (targetType === 'bunny') {\n                    icon.textContent = '🐰';\n                    label.textContent = 'Chú thỏ nhảy';\n                    this.level6Clouds.c1 = true;\n                    if (window.audioMgr) {\n                        window.audioMgr.playBling();\n                        window.audioMgr.speak('Bin', 'Kìa, một chú thỏ mây kìa Bố Mẹ ơi!');\n                    }\n                } else if (targetType === 'car') {\n                    icon.textContent = '🚗';\n                    label.textContent = 'Ô tô bon bon';\n                    this.level6Clouds.c2 = true;\n                    if (window.audioMgr) {\n                        window.audioMgr.playBling();\n                        window.audioMgr.speak('Bin', 'Oa, một chiếc ô tô mây đang chạy kìa!');\n                    }\n                } else if (targetType === 'watermelon') {\n                    icon.textContent = '🍉';\n                    label.textContent = 'Dưa hấu mây';\n                    this.level6Clouds.c3 = true;\n                    if (window.audioMgr) {\n                        window.audioMgr.playBling();\n                        window.audioMgr.speak('Bin', 'Miếng dưa hấu mây ngọt lịm ngon quá!');\n                    }\n                } else if (targetType === 'bear') {\n                    icon.textContent = '🐻';\n                    label.textContent = 'Chú gấu vẫy tay';\n                    this.level6Clouds.c4 = true;\n                    if (window.audioMgr) {\n                        window.audioMgr.playBling();\n                        window.audioMgr.speak('Bin', 'Chú gấu bông mây vẫy tay chào Bin kìa!');\n                    }\n                }\n\n                if (window.effectsMgr) {\n                    const r = card.getBoundingClientRect();\n                    window.effectsMgr.burstStarsAt(r.left + r.width / 2, r.top + r.height / 2);\n                }\n\n                if (this.level6Clouds.c1 && this.level6Clouds.c2 && this.level6Clouds.c3 && this.level6Clouds.c4) {\n                    if (btnNext6) {\n                        btnNext6.classList.remove('hidden');\n                        btnNext6.classList.add('pop-in');\n                    }\n                }\n            };\n        });\n\n        if (btnNext6) {\n            btnNext6.onclick = () => {\n                if (window.audioMgr) window.audioMgr.playPop();\n                this.initLevel7();\n                this.showScreen(7);\n            };\n        }\n    }\n\n    // ==========================================================================\n    // LEVEL 7: MÓN QUÀ LỊCH SỰ\n    // ==========================================================================\n    initLevel7() {\n        const slider = document.getElementById('volume-whisper-slider');\n        const sliderLabel = document.getElementById('whisper-status-label');\n        const legTarget = document.getElementById('bin-leg-target');\n        const legLabel = document.getElementById('leg-status-label');\n        const btnNext7 = document.getElementById('btn-next-level-7');\n\n        // Tình huống 1: Kéo âm lượng nói thầm\n        if (slider) {\n            slider.addEventListener('input', (e) => {\n                const val = parseInt(e.target.value, 10);\n                if (val <= 25) {\n                    if (!this.level7Tasks.volume) {\n                        this.level7Tasks.volume = true;\n                        if (sliderLabel) sliderLabel.textContent = '🤫 Bin nói thầm nhẹ nhàng ✓';\n                        slider.disabled = true;\n\n                        if (window.effectsMgr) {\n                            const r = slider.getBoundingClientRect();\n                            window.effectsMgr.spawnFloatingHeartsAt(r.left + r.width / 2, r.top);\n                        }\n\n                        if (window.audioMgr) {\n                            window.audioMgr.playTing();\n                            window.audioMgr.speak('Bin', 'Chúng mình nói khẽ cho mọi người nghỉ ngơi nhé!');\n                        }\n                        this.checkLevel7Completion();\n                    }\n                }\n            });\n        }\n\n        // Tình huống 2: Thu chân không đạp ghế trước\n        if (legTarget) {\n            legTarget.onclick = () => {\n                if (this.level7Tasks.leg) return;\n                this.leve